WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.460
Today we will use voice, space and roles to tell a story. Our work connects with

00:00:05.460 --> 00:00:07.432
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:08.283 --> 00:00:13.556
Assign a speaker, listener and narrator for a short scene. Name a design choice that

00:00:13.556 --> 00:00:15.665
a selected Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:19.904
Practise lines with clear facial expression and turn-taking.

00:00:20.783 --> 00:00:23.749
Act the scene once and revise a confusing gesture.
